Template: pplaunch/url_prefix
Type: select
Choices-C: control, next
Choices: CONTROL, NEXT
Default: control
Description: TFC URL prefix
 The panel loads https://[prefix].[instance].[base]

Template: pplaunch/redirect_mode
Type: select
Choices-C: tfc, custom
Choices: TFC instance, Custom URL
Default: tfc
Description: How should this panel connect?

Template: pplaunch/custom_url
Type: string
Description: Custom URL
 Full address, including https://

Template: pplaunch/loading_string
Type: string
Description: Loading prefix
 Shown as "<prefix> Is Launching" while the page loads.

Template: pplaunch/tfc_instance
Type: string
Description: TFC instance name
 The middle part of the TFC URL.

Template: pplaunch/base_url
Type: select
Choices-C: nep, tfc
Choices: .nepgroup.io, .tfclabs.com
Default: nep
Description: TFC base URL

Template: pplaunch/goofs_enabled
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Enable goofs (Space Invaders and picture changes)?

Template: pplaunch/configure_game
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Configure game settings now?

Template: pplaunch/unit
Type: string
Description: Unit (specific trailer)

Template: pplaunch/location
Type: select
Choices-C: audio, engineering, flex, production, replay, submix, td, video, non, custom
Choices: Audio, Engineering, Flex, Production, Replay, Submix, TD, Video, Non-Specific Location (tablet/iPad), Custom
Description: Panel location

Template: pplaunch/custom_location
Type: string
Description: Custom location name
